      "conversations": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-1"
                },
                " Can you recommend anywhere good to go?"
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Felix",
              "parts": [
                "Well, Mexico is a big country and there are lots of places to choose from. ",
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-2"
                },
                " If you want a relaxing holiday, there are some fantastic beaches all along the Caribbean coast."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-3"
                },
                " And I'm not really into it either."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Felix",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-4"
                },
                " There are amazing Mayan ruins throughout the area."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                "That sounds interesting. I think I saw a documentary about them on TV. They look like pyramids but with steps. Is that right?"
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Felix",
              "parts": [
                "Well, some of them are pyramids. Others are more like houses, or even palaces."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                "Wow! That sounds amazing."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Felix",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-5"
                },
                " There are lots of places for diving or snorkelling. You could also try kayaking if you like."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                "Oh, that's my idea of heaven!"
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Felix",
              "parts": [
                "OK, I can do an online check for the best places for doing that, if you want."
              ]
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Kim",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "questionId": "suggestions-2-6"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
